WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.799
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: Mini Project: One Task, Three Prompts.

2
00:00:07.099 --> 00:00:13.919
Finish a real task with three prompts: plan, draft, improve. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:14.917 --> 00:00:21.426
Step one. Prompt one is for planning. Ask for an outline of your task, such as a short speech about your school.

4
00:00:22.417 --> 00:00:27.904
Step two. Prompt two is for the draft. Ask for each part in simple English.

5
00:00:28.917 --> 00:00:36.996
Step three. Prompt three is for improving. Make it friendlier, shorter or more personal. Add your own name and details.

6
00:00:37.983 --> 00:00:44.890
Step four. Check the facts, and practise saying it aloud. Great work. You can now plan, draft and improve with AI.

7
00:00:45.883 --> 00:00:49.395
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:49.695 --> 00:00:53.958
Choose a real task: a speech, an email or a plan.

9
00:00:54.258 --> 00:00:57.744
Use three prompts: plan, draft and improve.

10
00:00:58.044 --> 00:01:00.055
Check the facts and make it your own.

11
00:01:00.355 --> 00:01:01.716
Well done!

